["<aside class=\"callout why\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Why it matters</div><p>Memory lies by Christmas. A journal turns ten trips into one lesson you can use next year.</p></aside><figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 282\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The journal lives only on your phone. Tap Export CSV, get a .csv file, open it in any spreadsheet. Export after each trip and save it off the phone, because a lost phone loses your seasons.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"282\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Back it up: Export CSV</text><g transform=\"translate(70 140) scale(2.6)\"><rect x=\"-10\" y=\"-18\" width=\"20\" height=\"36\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><rect x=\"-7\" y=\"-13\" width=\"14\" height=\"24\" fill=\"#dbe7f2\"/><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"14\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#fff\"/></g><rect x=\"44\" y=\"190\" width=\"54\" height=\"20\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><text x=\"71\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Export</text><line x1=\"110\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"160.0\" y2=\"140.0\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M152.8 143.5 L160.0 140.0 L152.8 136.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><g transform=\"translate(200 140) scale(2.0)\"><path d=\"M-14 -18 H8 L16 -10 V18 H-14 Z\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M-8 -6 H10 M-8 2 H10 M-8 10 H4\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/></g><text x=\"200\" y=\"200\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">.csv file</text><line x1=\"240\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"290.0\" y2=\"140.0\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M282.8 143.5 L290.0 140.0 L282.8 136.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"300\" y=\"100\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"300\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\"/><line x1=\"320\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"180\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\"/><line x1=\"300\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\"/><line x1=\"340\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"340\" y2=\"180\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\"/><line x1=\"300\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"160\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\"/><line x1=\"360\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"360\" y2=\"180\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\"/><text x=\"340\" y=\"200\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Spreadsheet</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"244\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Lives only on your phone. Lost phone = lost seasons.</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"266\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Export after each trip. Save it off the phone.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Seven fields, every trip, even blank days. Five minutes in the truck (Tip).</li><li>CSV (comma separated values) export is your backup <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: how the app journal works</summary><ul><li>The app journal has seven fields. Fill every one, after every trip, even the blank days.</li><li>It takes five minutes in the truck before you drive home (Tip).</li><li>Your journal lives only on your phone, in local storage. Use <strong>Export CSV</strong> after each trip as a backup (95%, how this app is built).</li><li>CSV (comma separated values) opens in any spreadsheet app.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 446\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The seven journal fields: date, one entry per day; place or MU, with your own pin name; species hunted; weather and wind, written as where the wind comes from; what you saw, with species, sex, number and time; shots and result, where no shots is an answer; and one lesson.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"446\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Seven fields, every trip</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"44\" width=\"185\" height=\"92\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><g transform=\"translate(40 78) scale(0.9)\"><rect x=\"-18\" y=\"-14\" width=\"36\" height=\"32\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"-18\" y=\"-14\" width=\"36\" height=\"9\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><path d=\"M-10 -18 v6 M10 -18 v6\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M-10 2 h4 M-2 2 h4 M6 2 h4 M-10 10 h4 M-2 10 h4\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/></g><text x=\"68\" y=\"68\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Date</text><text x=\"68\" y=\"86\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">One entry per</text><text x=\"68\" y=\"103\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">day</text><rect x=\"203\" y=\"44\" width=\"185\" height=\"92\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><g transform=\"translate(233 78) scale(0.9)\"><path d=\"M0 20 C-14 2 -14 -18 0 -18 C14 -18 14 2 0 20 Z\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><circle cy=\"-6\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#fff\"/></g><text x=\"261\" y=\"68\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Place or MU</text><text x=\"261\" y=\"86\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">MU plus your pin</text><text x=\"261\" y=\"103\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">name</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"144\" width=\"185\" height=\"92\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><g transform=\"translate(40 178) scale(0.9)\"><ellipse cx=\"2\" cy=\"2\" rx=\"15\" ry=\"8\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\"/><path d=\"M-10 8 v12 M-4 8 v12 M8 8 v12 M14 8 v12\" stroke=\"#8b5a2b\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M-12 -2 L-18 -12\" stroke=\"#8b5a2b\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><ellipse cx=\"-20\" cy=\"-14\" rx=\"6\" ry=\"4\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\"/><path d=\"M-19 -18 l-2 -8 m2 4 l4 -5 M-17 -18 l3 -6\" stroke=\"#6b4f35\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></g><text x=\"68\" y=\"168\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Species hunted</text><text x=\"68\" y=\"186\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">What you held a</text><text x=\"68\" y=\"203\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">licence for</text><rect x=\"203\" y=\"144\" width=\"185\" height=\"92\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><g transform=\"translate(233 178) scale(0.9)\"><path d=\"M-20 -8 H8 Q16 -8 16 -14 Q16 -20 9 -19 M-20 2 H14 Q22 2 22 9 Q22 16 14 15 M-20 12 H0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></g><text x=\"261\" y=\"168\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Weather and</text><text x=\"261\" y=\"186\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">wind</text><text x=\"261\" y=\"204\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Wind FROM,</text><text x=\"261\" y=\"221\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">morning and</text><text x=\"261\" y=\"238\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">evening</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"244\" width=\"185\" height=\"92\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><g transform=\"translate(40 278) scale(0.9)\"><rect x=\"-18\" y=\"-10\" width=\"14\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><rect x=\"4\" y=\"-10\" width=\"14\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><rect x=\"-6\" y=\"-4\" width=\"12\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><circle cx=\"-11\" cy=\"10\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#dbe7f2\"/><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"10\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#dbe7f2\"/></g><text x=\"68\" y=\"268\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">What you saw</text><text x=\"68\" y=\"286\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Species, sex,</text><text x=\"68\" y=\"303\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">number, time</text><rect x=\"203\" y=\"244\" width=\"185\" height=\"92\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><g transform=\"translate(233 278) scale(0.9)\"><circle r=\"16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M0 -20 V-6 M0 6 V20 M-20 0 H-6 M6 0 H20\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></g><text x=\"261\" y=\"268\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Shots and</text><text x=\"261\" y=\"286\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">result</text><text x=\"261\" y=\"304\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">&quot;No shots&quot; is an</text><text x=\"261\" y=\"321\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">answer</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"344\" width=\"185\" height=\"92\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><g transform=\"translate(40 378) scale(0.9)\"><path d=\"M0 -18 L5 -6 L18 -6 L8 2 L12 15 L0 7 L-12 15 L-8 2 L-18 -6 L-5 -6 Z\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/></g><text x=\"68\" y=\"368\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">One lesson</text><text x=\"68\" y=\"386\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">One. Not five</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Place: MU (Management Unit) plus your own pin name. No landowner names (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: what to write in each field</summary><div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr><th>Field</th><th>What to write (Tip)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Date</td><td>Pick it. One entry per day, not per trip</td></tr><tr><td>Place or MU</td><td>MU (Management Unit) plus your own pin name: \"3-27, bench A1\". No private landowner names</td></tr><tr><td>Species hunted</td><td>What you held a licence for and were looking for</td></tr><tr><td>Weather and wind</td><td>Temperature, sky, wind direction morning and evening, snow line, moon if you track it</td></tr><tr><td>What you saw</td><td>Every animal: species, sex, number, time, where, what it was doing</td></tr><tr><td>Shots and result</td><td>Shots fired, distance, hit or miss, recovered or not. \"No shots\" is an answer</td></tr><tr><td>One lesson</td><td>One thing to repeat or one thing to fix. One, not five</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 308\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Vague versus useful journal entries. Saw some deer early, versus 7:40 am, 3 does feeding, south bench. Windy, versus west wind, from the west. About 200 yards, versus 210 m by rangefinder. Nothing today, versus no deer and 1 truck at the gate.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"308\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Write it so next year can use it</text><text x=\"105\" y=\"54\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Vague</text><text x=\"298\" y=\"54\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#55663f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Useful</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"64\" width=\"186\" height=\"52\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#fdf0e6\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"90\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><path d=\"M19 85 l10 10 M29 85 l-10 10\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"38\" y=\"86\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">saw some deer early</text><rect x=\"204\" y=\"64\" width=\"186\" height=\"52\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f3f6ec\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"218\" cy=\"90\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><path d=\"M212 90 l4 5 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"232\" y=\"86\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">7:40 am, 3 does</text><text x=\"232\" y=\"103\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">feeding, south bench</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"124\" width=\"186\" height=\"52\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#fdf0e6\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"150\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><path d=\"M19 145 l10 10 M29 145 l-10 10\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"38\" y=\"146\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">windy</text><rect x=\"204\" y=\"124\" width=\"186\" height=\"52\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f3f6ec\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"218\" cy=\"150\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><path d=\"M212 150 l4 5 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"232\" y=\"146\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">west wind (from the</text><text x=\"232\" y=\"163\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">west)</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"184\" width=\"186\" height=\"52\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#fdf0e6\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"210\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><path d=\"M19 205 l10 10 M29 205 l-10 10\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"38\" y=\"206\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">about 200 yards</text><rect x=\"204\" y=\"184\" width=\"186\" height=\"52\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f3f6ec\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"218\" cy=\"210\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><path d=\"M212 210 l4 5 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"232\" y=\"206\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">210 m, rangefinder</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"244\" width=\"186\" height=\"52\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#fdf0e6\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"270\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><path d=\"M19 265 l10 10 M29 265 l-10 10\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"38\" y=\"266\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">nothing today</text><rect x=\"204\" y=\"244\" width=\"186\" height=\"52\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f3f6ec\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"218\" cy=\"270\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><path d=\"M212 270 l4 5 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"232\" y=\"266\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">no deer, 1 truck at</text><text x=\"232\" y=\"283\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">the gate</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><figure class=\"diagram anim\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 312\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Animation: a compass with arrows of wind flowing from the west side toward the east. A west wind blows from the west. Write the wind as where it comes from.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"312\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">&quot;West wind&quot; blows FROM the west</text><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"170\" r=\"90\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">N</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"280\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">S</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"176\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">W</text><text x=\"308\" y=\"176\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">E</text><g><path d=\"M0 0 h50 m-10 -7 l10 7 l-10 7\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" values=\"110 130;240 130\" dur=\"2.4s\" begin=\"0.0s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/></g><g><path d=\"M0 0 h50 m-10 -7 l10 7 l-10 7\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" values=\"110 170;240 170\" dur=\"2.4s\" begin=\"0.5s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/></g><g><path d=\"M0 0 h50 m-10 -7 l10 7 l-10 7\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" values=\"110 210;240 210\" dur=\"2.4s\" begin=\"1.0s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/></g><text x=\"200\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Write where it comes from.</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption>A west wind blows from the west. <button class=\"anim-replay\">↻ Replay</button></figcaption></figure><ul><li>Times beat feelings. Blank days are data (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the full list</summary><ul><li>Times beat feelings. \"7:40 am, 3 does feeding, south bench\" beats \"saw some deer early\" (Tip).</li><li>Write the wind as where it came <strong>from</strong>: \"west wind\" blows from the west (90%, standard weather usage).</li><li>Write the distance you measured, not the distance you guessed (Tip). A rangefinder number or a map measure.</li><li>Log people too: other hunters, trucks at the gate, shots heard. That is hunting pressure (Tip).</li><li>Blank days are data. Where deer are not is half the map (Tip).</li><li>Keep your licences and records until the meat is eaten. The law needs the documents, and the journal tells you where they are (99%, synopsis page 7).</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 326\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Timeline of journal reviews. After every trip: read the last entry before planning the next. End of November: deer seen per hour for each spot. January: pick the three best and three dead spots, and answer the Hunter Sample Questionnaire. By 31 March: the Mandatory Hunter Report if you bought an elk, moose or caribou licence. August: turn last year&#x27;s lessons into checklist items.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"326\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Read it back through the year</text><line x1=\"120\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"300\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"64\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><text x=\"106\" y=\"69\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#55663f\" text-anchor=\"end\">After a trip</text><text x=\"136\" y=\"69\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Read the last entry first</text><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"110\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><text x=\"106\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#55663f\" text-anchor=\"end\">End of Nov</text><text x=\"136\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Deer seen per hour, per spot</text><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"156\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><text x=\"106\" y=\"161\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#55663f\" text-anchor=\"end\">January</text><text x=\"136\" y=\"161\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Best 3 and dead 3 spots</text><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"202\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><text x=\"106\" y=\"207\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"end\">January</text><text x=\"136\" y=\"207\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Questionnaire comes</text><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"248\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><text x=\"106\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"end\">By 31 Mar</text><text x=\"136\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Hunter Report: elk, moose,</text><text x=\"136\" y=\"269\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">caribou</text><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"294\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><text x=\"106\" y=\"299\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#55663f\" text-anchor=\"end\">August</text><text x=\"136\" y=\"299\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Last year&#x27;s lessons become</text><text x=\"136\" y=\"315\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">checklists</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Mandatory Hunter Report: elk, moose or caribou licence buyers, by 31 March <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the six reviews in full</summary><ol><li><strong>After every trip:</strong> read the last entry before you plan the next one (Tip).</li><li><strong>End of November:</strong> list every spot and count deer seen per hour hunted (Tip).</li><li><strong>January:</strong> read the whole season with your brother. Pick the three best spots and the three dead ones (Tip).</li><li><strong>January also:</strong> the Hunter Sample Questionnaire is mailed to many licence holders. Your journal makes it easy to answer (99%, synopsis page 16).</li><li><strong>By 31 March:</strong> anyone who bought an elk, moose or caribou species licence must file the <button class=\"term\" data-term=\"Mandatory Hunter Report\">Mandatory Hunter Report</button> (99%, synopsis page 16). Your journal has the days and areas.</li><li><strong>August:</strong> read last year's lessons before you scout. Turn each one into a checklist item (Tip).</li></ol></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 606\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A journal page, example only, not a real hunt. Date: a mid October Saturday. Place: MU 3-27, bench A1, glassed from knob A1G. Species: mule deer. Weather and wind: 2 C at 6:30 am, clear, light wind from the north, swung to the south by 9 am. What you saw: 6:58 am, 2 does and a fawn feeding on the bench edge. 7:25 am, they walked into timber. No bucks. One truck at the gate.. Shots and result: no shots. One lesson: the wind swung by 9. Leave the knob by 8:45 next time or use spot B..\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"606\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<rect x=\"6\" y=\"6\" width=\"388\" height=\"594\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fffef6\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"22\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"22\" y2=\"592\" stroke=\"#e3a7a0\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"76\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"76\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"96\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"116\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"136\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"136\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"156\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"156\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"176\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"176\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"196\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"196\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"216\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"216\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee