x=\"30\" y=\"106\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1d3557\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-style=\"italic\">a mid October Saturday</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"start\">Place</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"156\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1d3557\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-style=\"italic\">MU 3-27, bench A1, glassed from</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"176\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1d3557\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-style=\"italic\">knob A1G</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"206\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"start\">Species</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"226\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1d3557\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-style=\"italic\">mule deer</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"256\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"start\">Weather and wind</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"276\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1d3557\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-style=\"italic\">2 C at 6:30 am, clear, light wind</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"296\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1d3557\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-style=\"italic\">from the north, swung to the south</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"316\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1d3557\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-style=\"italic\">by 9 am</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"346\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"start\">What you saw</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"366\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1d3557\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-style=\"italic\">6:58 am, 2 does and a fawn feeding</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"386\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1d3557\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-style=\"italic\">on the bench edge. 7:25 am, they</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"406\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1d3557\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-style=\"italic\">walked into timber. No bucks. One</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"426\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1d3557\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-style=\"italic\">truck at the gate.</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"456\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"start\">Shots and result</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"476\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1d3557\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-style=\"italic\">no shots</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"506\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"start\">One lesson</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"526\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1d3557\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-style=\"italic\">the wind swung by 9. Leave the</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"546\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1d3557\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-style=\"italic\">knob by 8:45 next time or use spot</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"566\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1d3557\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-style=\"italic\">B.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>No deer worth a shot, and still a lesson worth writing (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the example as text</summary><aside class=\"callout tip\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Tip (opinion)</div><p><strong>Example only, not a real hunt.</strong></p><ul><li>Date: a mid October Saturday</li><li>Place: MU 3-27, bench A1, glassed from knob A1G</li><li>Species: mule deer</li><li>Weather and wind: 2 C at 6:30 am, clear, light wind from the north, swung to the south by 9 am</li><li>What you saw: 6:58 am, 2 does and a fawn feeding on the bench edge. 7:25 am, they walked into timber. No bucks. One truck at the gate.</li><li>Shots and result: no shots</li><li>One lesson: the wind swung by 9. Leave the knob by 8:45 next time or use spot B.</li></ul></aside></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 566\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A journal page, example only, not a real hunt. Date: an early November weekday. Place: MU 3-27, cutblock edge B2. Species: white tailed deer. Weather and wind: minus 4 C, 3 cm fresh snow, wind from the west all day. What you saw: 4:10 pm, 1 buck at the timber edge, walking, never stopped. Shots and result: 1 shot, ranged 210 m (230 yd), off hand, clean miss. Checked for hair and blood 30 minutes: none. One lesson: no rest, moving deer. Practise sitting and kneeling shots, and wait for a stop or pass..\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"566\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<rect x=\"6\" y=\"6\" width=\"388\" height=\"554\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fffef6\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"22\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"22\" y2=\"552\" stroke=\"#e3a7a0\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"76\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"76\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"96\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"116\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"136\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"136\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"156\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"156\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"176\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"176\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"196\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"196\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"216\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"216\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"236\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"236\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"256\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"256\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"276\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"276\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"296\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"296\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"316\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"316\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"336\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"336\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"356\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"356\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"376\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"376\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"396\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"396\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"416\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"416\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"436\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"436\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"456\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"456\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"476\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"476\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"496\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"496\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"516\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"516\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"536\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"536\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"34\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Example 2: a miss</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"56\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Example only, not a real hunt</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"86\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"start\">Date</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"106\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1d3557\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-style=\"italic\">an early November weekday</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"start\">Place</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"156\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1d3557\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-style=\"italic\">MU 3-27, cutblock edge B2</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"186\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"start\">Species</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"206\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1d3557\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-style=\"italic\">white tailed deer</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"236\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"start\">Weather and wind</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"256\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1d3557\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-style=\"italic\">minus 4 C, 3 cm fresh snow, wind</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"276\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1d3557\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-style=\"italic\">from the west all day</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"306\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"start\">What you saw</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"326\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1d3557\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-style=\"italic\">4:10 pm, 1 buck at the timber</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"346\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1d3557\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-style=\"italic\">edge, walking, never stopped</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"376\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"start\">Shots and result</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"396\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1d3557\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-style=\"italic\">1 shot, ranged 210 m (230 yd), off</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"416\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1d3557\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-style=\"italic\">hand, clean miss. Checked for hair</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"436\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1d3557\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-style=\"italic\">and blood 30 minutes: none</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"466\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"start\">One lesson</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"486\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1d3557\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-style=\"italic\">no rest, moving deer. Practise</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"506\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1d3557\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-style=\"italic\">sitting and kneeling shots, and</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"526\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1d3557\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-style=\"italic\">wait for a stop or pass.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>A miss written down is practice planned (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the example as text</summary><aside class=\"callout tip\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Tip (opinion)</div><p><strong>Example only, not a real hunt.</strong></p><ul><li>Date: an early November weekday</li><li>Place: MU 3-27, cutblock edge B2</li><li>Species: white tailed deer</li><li>Weather and wind: minus 4 C, 3 cm fresh snow, wind from the west all day</li><li>What you saw: 4:10 pm, 1 buck at the timber edge, walking, never stopped</li><li>Shots and result: 1 shot, ranged 210 m (230 yd), off hand, clean miss. Checked for hair and blood 30 minutes: none</li><li>One lesson: no rest, moving deer. Practise sitting and kneeling shots, and wait for a stop or pass.</li></ul></aside></details>","<aside class=\"callout rule\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Grandpa's rule (wisdom, not law)</div><p>Grandpa's rule (wisdom): Write it down tonight. Tomorrow you will remember a bigger buck and a shorter walk.</p></aside><aside class=\"callout mistake\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Common mistakes</div><ul><li>Logging only the days you saw something. The blank days show you where not to go.</li><li>Writing \"windy\" instead of a direction. You cannot plan the next trip from \"windy\".</li><li>Never exporting. A lost phone takes three seasons of notes with it.</li></ul></aside><aside class=\"callout field\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Do this in the field</div><p>Tonight, enter your last trip in the app, all seven fields. Then tap Export CSV and save the file somewhere off the phone.</p></aside>","<ul><li>Hunt Mentor app, journal screen: field list and Export CSV button, read from the app code, checked 2026-10-02 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li><a href=\"https://www2.gov.bc.ca/assets/gov/sports-recreation-arts-and-culture/outdoor-recreation/fishing-and-hunting/hunting/regulations/hunting-trapping-synopsis.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BC Hunting and Trapping Regulations Synopsis 2026 to 2028</a>, read directly, checked 2026-10-02: page 7 (keeping licences and records), page 16 (Hunter Sample Questionnaire, Mandatory Hunter Report). 99%.</li><li>Wind direction convention: standard weather usage <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">90%</span>.</li><li>Everything else: journal habits, labelled Tip. The two entries are made up examples.</li></ul>"]